      <div type="clause" n="63">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 63</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Reaflac. Gyf hwa reaflac gewyrce, agyue ⁊ forgylde ⁊ beo his weres scyldig wið ðone kinincg.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Robbery. If anyone is guilty of robbery, he shall restore [the stolen goods], and pay the injured man as much again, and forfeit his wergeld to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa reaflac gewyrce, agyfe ⁊ forgylde, ⁊ beo his weres scyldig wið þone cingc (oððe wið þone þe his socne age).</ab>
      </div>
